# apps/zugov-frontend/public/*.wasm ships fine (nothing above matches *.wasm), but its paired
# proving key needs an explicit carve-out from the blanket *.zkey rule above, or a fresh
# checkout (exactly what CI does) never has it — voters' in-browser poll-joining proof
# generation needs both files together; shipping the .wasm without the .zkey silently breaks
# it (the missing file's request falls through to the SPA's index.html instead of a real 404).
!apps/zugov-frontend/public/PollJoining_10_test.0.zkey


